---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base>
  <section class="page">
    <h1 class="kicker">Get Involved</h1>
    <p class="quote">““Each of you should use whatever gift you have received to serve others, as faithful stewards of God’s grace in its various forms.”</p>
    <p class="subtitle">1 Peter 4:10</p>
    <p>This is your parish. Every ministry needs people. Contact Mary Meissner, (719) 542-9248 ext. 111, mmeissner@ctkpueblo.org, to sign up.</p>

    <h2>Liturgical ministers</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Lector</li>
      <li>Extraordinary Minister of Holy Communion</li>
      <li>Altar server</li>
      <li>Usher</li>
      <li>Hospitality</li>
      <li>Music ministry</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Teaching and formation</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Catechist or aide for children</li>
      <li>Catechist or aide for youth</li>
      <li>Adult formation</li>
      <li>OCIA team</li>
      <li>Vacation Bible School</li>
      <li>Family formation sessions</li>
      <li>Youth events and retreats</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Prayer and care of the church</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Prayer line</li>
      <li>Care of the narthex prayer spaces and votive candles</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Works of mercy</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Pueblo Soup Kitchen - Contact Executive Director, Kathy Cline at 719-545-6540 </li> 
      <li>Sangre de Cristo Hospice - Call 719-542-0032</li>
      <li>Posada family shelter - Call 719-545-8776</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Parish organizations</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Altar and Rosary Society</li>
      <li>Knights of Columbus</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .page {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 12px 32px 64px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
.quote {
  text-align: center;
  font-style: italic !important;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem;
}

.subtitle {
  text-align: center;
  font-weight: bold;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem;
}
h1 {
  text-align: center !important;
  color: var(--gold);
  font-weight: 600;
  margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  padding-bottom: 0.6rem;
}

.quote {
  text-align: center;
  font-style: italic !important;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem;
}

.subtitle {
  text-align: center;
  font-weight: bold;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem;
}

  h2 {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold);
    font-family: "Source Sans 3", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  h3 {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    font-family: "Source Sans 3", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  p {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  ul {
    list-style-type: disc;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin: 0.4rem 0 1.25rem;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .calendar {
    margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--gold);
  }

  .calendar iframe {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 600px;
    border: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .page {
      padding: 8px 4px 40px;
    }

  }
</style>
